            <div xml:id="d72">

                <pb facs="0144" n="110" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg110"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 72.</note>
                <head>Mr. E. B. Washburne to Mr. Fish.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[By cable telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1870-09-03"><hi rendition="#small-caps">September</hi> 3,
                            1870</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>McMahon totally defeated. Capture of Sedan. Defeat of Bazaine before Metz. In
                    Chamber Favre considered present government extinct<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >;</hi> proposed military dictator. Unofficial dispatch to foreign minister
                    that Emperor prisoner, another reports him escaped to Belgium.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WASHBURNE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
